  "details": "## Description\n\nI think at least, I don't have many resources to like go and re-produce this issue. But basically. When you accept someone that is offline, they'll appear Online at the right until you refresh, it seems like. Which is a small strange little issue.\n\n## Re-production Steps\n\n- Get a friend request\n\n- They should be offline\n\n- Accept it on the website\n\n- Observer the side bar\n\n## Expected Result\n\nThat if they're offline they shouldn't show up as online, right after accepting.\n\n## Actual Result\n\nIt looks like they appear as Online right after you accept, but only on the sidebar and when you refresh then it is fixed.",
